  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Crusade for Mwansakombe Chiefdom Cooking Oil Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YCMD is requesting USADF for the following support to enable it processes and market cooking oil in its chiefdom and surrounding communities: Seed revolving fund to purchase improved groundnuts (MGV4 and 5) for distribution to 400 farmers; Training of beneficiary farmers in sustainable agriculture production; Crop purchase fund to purchase groundnuts from farmers; Processing equipment (oil expelling/ filter machine); Rentals for ware house to accommodate equipment and storage of raw materials; Training of the management team, particularly the operator in processing, packaging and quality control procedures; Management team (to include understudy for business manager and bookkeeper) to oversee the operations of the enterprise, office space, appropriate office equipment and motor bike for transport; Training of the board and management in enterprise development and marketing, operations and maintenance of equipment and a study tour to a similar enterprise that is processing oilseeds; Establish financial and business systems for the enterprise; and Develop five year business plan that will articulate how enterprise will increase its production and marketing activities</narrative>
  </description>
